WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.506 --> 00:00:03.834 line:3%
  Bulma's vehicle collects four hundred and  
  seventy thousand pounds from investors.  

2
00:00:04.305 --> 00:00:09.469 line:3%
  Twenty thousand goes on costs, so  
  four hundred and fifty thousand buys  
  three percent of Senzu Labs.  

3
00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:11.682 line:3%
  Goku puts in a hundred and  
  forty-one thousand.  

4
00:00:12.148 --> 00:00:15.433 line:3%
  At the round price, his stake is worth a  
  hundred and thirty-five thousand.  

5
00:00:16.117 --> 00:00:19.381 line:3%
  Later, another round dilutes the  
  vehicle to two point four percent.  

6
00:00:20.001 --> 00:00:21.686 line:3%
  One vehicle, one asset.  

7
00:00:22.178 --> 00:00:25.397 line:3%
  Every step takes something, so read  
  what your money turns into.  

8
00:00:26.497 --> 00:00:27.457 line:3%
  Vegeta.  
